    "dos": [
      "Do open every block with a full-ink 1px rule and divide rows with hair.",
      "Do declare opsz on every serif setting; serif headings at 500.",
      "Do keep oxblood to actions plus one italic <em> per view.",
      "Do caption images below in soft ink at 0.875rem.",
      "Do keep targets at least 44px (buttons and inputs 48px) with a 2px ink focus outline offset 3px.",
      "Do alternate paper and stone sections, end on the oxblood inquiry, close with the ink footer.",
      "Do write in Ich-Form with Sie, using only facts on hand; never invent testimonials, numbers or logos."
