    "donts": [
      "Don't set eyebrows or kickers above headlines.",
      "Don't build icon-tile card grids or icon feature boxes.",
      "Don't use gradients, glassmorphism or backdrop blur.",
      "Don't add decorative shadows beyond phone lift, menu layer and consent layer.",
      "Don't introduce a second hue or fill large areas with oxblood outside the closing section.",
